Shocked and went to prison incessantly, came back shocked again, but took more robberies and was handcuffed by the military
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of November 20, 2018, the Phnom Penh Military Police sent 5 suspects to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to be convicted in connection with a case of motorcycle robbery and a history of electric shock in Phnom Penh.
It should be reminded that on November 17, 2018, there was a case of 5 hippies chasing and kicking one of the victims' motorbike in order to rob the motorbike, but were arrested by the patrol force of the local military in Sen Sok district. Immediately on the spot at Street 1011, Phnom Penh Thmey Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok and sent to the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie Command for further investigation.
Under professional measures, the Phnom Penh Military Police arrested and arrested three other party members on November 18, 2018. The five suspects who were detained by the military include: Yan Chanchhaya, 17, Kong Sovanrith, 16, Sok Chamroeun, 15, and Bali. From Seng Heng, 18 years old and 5: Mang Cheat Sopheak, 15 years old.
According to the investigation of the Phnom Penh Municipal Military Police, the five suspects were found to have been involved in acts of electric shock in Phnom Penh and had been imprisoned in drug detention centers and had fled the district, such as:
Sok Chamroeun, alias Bali, was imprisoned in Prey Sar prison during April 2017 for one year in connection with an electric shock case, and when he returned, he continued his electric shock business several times until he forgot and went to another level, which was robbery.
Pi Seng Heng was imprisoned at the Opportunity Drug Detention Center in March 2017 for one year in connection with drug cases, and came out during September 2018, and participated in several robberies with his accomplices. Forget about the geography of Phnom Penh.
Mang Cheat Sopheak fled the district for 3 months from Phnom Penh to hide in Kampot province in 2017 after he was active in Phnom Penh and saw the news that one of his party members was arrested. Sent to Prey Sar Prison. After fleeing the district for a while, he returned to Phnom Penh to carry out the robbery.
The most surprising thing is that on November 17, 2018, before the motorcycle robbery, these young thieves shocked the phone three times in the most arrogant way: at night On November 16, 2018, they seized a mobile phone from a male victim riding a tricycle at the 5 Makara flyover.
At around 2 pm on the 17th, they discharged another mobile phone from a male victim riding a motorcycle in front of a Southeast Asian television station. At around 5 pm on the 17th, they snatched another mobile phone from a woman who was taking pictures near Aeon Market 2, Khan Sen Sok.
Then, at 11 pm on November 17, the thieves robbed a motorbike at the intersection of Street 1011, Phnom Penh Thmey Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, chasing the victim and kicking the victim. The victim fell and chased the victim to run away from the motorcycle, then they went down on the victim's motorcycle to escape, but unfortunately was also cracked down on by the military.
