(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of November 20, 2018, Colonel Hour Meng Wang, Police Inspector of Sen Sok District, presented the suspects as the killers of two men and women who tortured a sex worker to death. The two also transported the bodies of the victims to be dumped at the entrance of Wat Teuk Thla on the night of November 15, 2018.
On the afternoon of November 15, 2018, without seeing any relatives, Mr. Achar reported to the competent authorities to come down to the morgue. Immediately after receiving this information, the district police visited and contacted the forensic experts of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police.
After the forensic experts arrived, they found that the body of the victim was beaten and tortured, causing bruises all over her body until she died.
Later, the police force of Sen Sok District Police Inspectorate cooperated with Phnom Penh Serious Criminal Police Force and Tuol Kork District Police Inspectorate to search for the suspect who was the brutal killer. Until the night of November 18, 2018, the police force of Sen Sok district arrested two male and female suspects for interrogation at the Sen Sok district inspector on suspicion of being involved in the torture of a sex worker to death.
After questioning the two suspects, on the morning of November 19, 2018, the Sen Sok District Police Force cooperated with the Tuol Kork District Police Force to search the location of a brothel under the brand name Massage. Street 598 in Sangkat Toek Laak 2, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh, where the woman was tortured. Meanwhile, the mastermind who is the mastermind of this house escaped.
After presenting the suspects as brutal killers, the authorities sent them to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to be punished according to legal procedures.
