An Electrician in Boeung Keng Kang, Phnom Penh Wins 70 Million Riels from Carabao Energy Drink
(Phnom Penh): A man with a career as a private electrician working in an apartment, currently living temporarily in Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I, Khan Chamkar Mon, Phnom Penh, was lucky to win the grand prize of Carabao energy drink worth 70 million Riel.
Speaking to the team and journalists who handed over the prizes to the accommodation, the lucky man said that he was 47-year-old Mom Savoeun, a native of Pursat province, but due to his living conditions. And his wife decided to move to Phnom Penh to work as a private electrician.
This past weekend, after returning from work exhausted, he brought a can of Carabao energy drink, which his wife, a salesman, already eats.
When I finished eating, I suddenly saw a prize of 70 million riels on the earring. Suddenly, he was very happy and excited and told his wife to check, and in the morning he called to inform the company through the phone number on the earring.
He stated that after receiving the prize money of 70 million riels, he will take some to buy land to build a house, because today only live in the house of the boss and leave some to create a business to support the family in the future.
He also thanked Carabao Beverage Company for creating a huge reward program for customers and also called on the general public to continue to support Carabao energy drinks for a chance to get lucky like him.
Winners will be lucky to win a grand prize of 70 million Riel, the seller of the grand prize will be lucky to receive a prize of 7 million Riel. 700,000 Riels.
