At the same time, Mr. Khim Bunsong also mentioned the results of cooperation with the sister cities of the People's Republic of China and Siem Reap on agriculture, education, scholarships and health by sending volunteer doctors for treatment. Free medical care for cataracts, as well as exchange of study tours with each other.
