(Kampong Thom): Ms. Khuon Khundy, Senator, Dr. Chiv Keng, Deputy Chief of the Supreme Court, and Ms. Chhay Sina Chiv Keng, Monks of the Kampong Svay Pagoda Buddhist Acharya Committee in Kampong Svay Village, Kampong Svay Commune, Kampong Svay District, Kampong Thom Province, initiated the Solidarity Charity Ceremony. To collect suffixes for monks to build a bridge across Stung Sen, Stung Sen City, Kampong Thom Province, which is planned to cost about $ 380,000.
