(Phnom Penh): The police force of the Office of Anti-Human Trafficking and Protection of Minors in cooperation with the local police in Meanchey district cracked down on the massage parlor brand "Vanny Reak Reay" with embedded sex services by minors and arrested 6 people, including the owner of the location One and five female victims.
