According to the police, the owner of the location is Huot Sovanny, a 36-year-old female who lives at the massage place at 32B, Street 217, Stung Meanchey, Sangkat Stung Meanchey, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh. "Vanny Reakreay" brand massage parlor is open from 10:00 am to 2:00 am, with 5 young and old women waiting for guests to come for a massage and have sex for 20 times. US $ to US $ 25.
