70 Delegates of National Association of Capital-Provincial Councils Visit Agra Mong Reththy's Agro-Industrial Zone
(Preah Sihanouk): On November 17, 2018, Mr. Mop Sarin, President of Phnom Penh Capital Council and President of National Association of Capital and Provincial Councils, led a delegation of 70 Capital and Provincial Councils from 13 provinces to visit and learn about development. Economy in the agro-industrial area of Dr. Mong Reththy in Sihanoukville.
The delegation visited palm oil plantations, feed mills, rubber plantations and Keo Phos port.
About 70 Capital-Provincial Council delegates and council secretaries are from Phnom Penh, Kampong Cham, Kampong Thom, Preah Vihear, Kratie, Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri, Mondulkiri, Tbong Khmum, Oddar Meanchey, Banteay Meanchey, Battambang and Kampong Chhnang.
