(Phnom Penh): To promote and enhance friendly cooperation between Phnom Penh, Cambodia and Nanning, Guangxi Province, China, as well as to promote reciprocal visits between Phnom Penh and Nanning on November 16, 2018. The Nanning Tourism and Cooperation Delegation held a meeting to promote tourism at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh.
Mr. So Mara, Deputy Minister of Tourism of Cambodia and Ms. Chhay Sivlin, President of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents (CATA) and representatives of more than 20 travel agencies from Phnom Penh attended the meeting.
Representing the 7 million people of Nanning, Cai Zhizhong extended a warm welcome to the Cambodian people. He hopes that through active cooperation and tourism exchanges of the two countries, the people of the two countries can enjoy each other's rich and beautiful tourism resources.
According to the report, tourism cooperation between Nanning and Phnom Penh has a good foundation. Since 2007, China has advertised the launch of direct flights from Nanning to Phnom Penh. The flight was in stable operating condition.
Traffic between the two cities is easy, and tourism, culture and economy, as well as trade, are becoming closer. From Phnom Penh to Nanning, the number of tourists has been increasing year by year, and Phnom Penh has become an important source of tourists visiting Nanning.
To raise awareness of the current state of Nanning tourism in the tourism and information industry in Phnom Penh, Nanning has carefully integrated Nanning tourism products according to the tourism needs of Phnom Penh tourists and launched a number of tourist routes. High quality, especially for tourists. The conference aims to further promote tourism cooperation between Nanning and Phnom Penh.
Details of Nanning were also presented at the presentation meeting. Nanning currently operates 25 international flights to 10 ASEAN countries, including three air routes from Nanning to Cambodia, including Nanning to Phnom Penh, Siem Reap and Sihanoukville.
The 47 scenic spots have created excellent tourism such as ecotourism, health tourism, indigenous tourism and were honored by the scenic city in 2017. The 12th China Garden Fair will be held in Nanning, China this year. Members of the delegation expressed their pleasure to welcome all Cambodian tourists to Nanning.
At the Nanning Tourism Promotion Conference today, the Nanning Tourism Department also signed a letter requesting strategic tourism cooperation with CATA, hoping to bring more opportunities for cooperation through the meeting.
