(Takeo): In line with the motto "Reading is the treasure of science" and continue to contribute to the reading habits of students and promote human resources in Cambodia, a brand new green library building built and funded by the Foundation PRASAC and co-implemented the project by the Curriculum Development Department of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
Mr. Oum Sam Oeun, Executive Vice President of PRASAC, stated that the library building at Andong Samreth Primary and Secondary School is 9 meters by 12 meters, built of stone with a tiled roof, with the full support of PRASAC Foundation. PRASAC not only provides the library building but also supports the equipment of resources, materials, documents and training of librarians to make this library run smoothly and sustainably.
