As of 2018, PRASAC has built a total of 30 library buildings in 9 provinces, including Takeo, Kampong Speu, Kampong Cham, Kandal, Prey Veng, Kampong Thom, Siem Reap, Preah Vihear and Battambang, with more than 77,000 students from 343 villages.
