He also instructed all people who come to the hospital in Oddar Meanchey province to take medicine regularly according to the doctor's schedule to recover from the disease, especially when Back home, take care of your health by living clean, eating clean and sleeping under a mosquito net to prevent illness.
However, that afternoon, Mr. Mam Bunheng also met with the leaders of the Department of Health and Oddar Meanchey Provincial Health Officers and instructed all provincial health officials to disseminate widely to the people about the progress and provision. Health services to ensure that more people with health problems are consulted and treated at public hospitals.
