The Bar Association considered that the call to use the functions, roles and status as a lawyer was different from the truth, misleading the public and causing damage to the honor and dignity of lawyers and the Bar Association. The Bar Association of Cambodia also announced that it would take all possible measures in accordance with legal procedures.
A statement from the Bar Association stated, "The Bar Association categorically denies that Heang Rithy is a registered lawyer with the Bar Association of the Kingdom of Cambodia."
The Bar Association also claimed that the misrepresentation of the functions, roles and status of lawyers made in the RFA interview was a violation of the Law on Lawyers, Code of Conduct for Lawyers and the Rules of Procedure of the Bar Association of the Kingdom. Cambodia.
The Bar Association reaction came after Heang Rithy used his role as a lawyer in an interview with RFA to criticize the court's move to place Kem Sokha under judicial supervision, which put him at risk. He seems to be under house arrest.
