Please be informed that on November 14th, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen visited and distributed humanitarian gifts to the elderly, homeless, widows, children, orphans, the disabled and people born or infected with HIV. 1,358 families from 15 villages, 3 communes of Keo Seima district, Mondulkiri province, in Chhneng village, Sre Khtom commune, Keo Seima district.
At the same time, the people also received a piece of white cloth and an additional 10,000 Riels as a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and Samdech Kittipritthbandit.
The Bar Association reaction came after Heang Rith, the former president of the Beehive Party, used his position as a lawyer in the media while he was not a lawyer on the bar list.
Mr. Suon Visal claimed that Mr. Heang Rithi might be breaking the law if he was found to be cheating as a lawyer. He claims that people who pretend to be lawyers can be fined and violate the criminal law of the Kingdom of Cambodia. He stated that a legitimate lawyer, after passing an examination and qualification examination by the Bar Council, and his name must be included in the list of the Bar Association.
It should be noted that the reaction of the Bar Association to Mr. Heang Rithy also came after RFA on the night of November 13, 2018 called Mr. Heang Rithy as "Dr. Heang Rithy".
On November 14, 2018, Mr. Kim Santepheap, the spokesman of the Ministry of Justice, came out to reprimand a lawyer named Heang Rithy who did not understand the law related to the court procedure in placing the accused under control. Judicial review.
Mr. Kim Santepheap said: "Even if the content of Article 223 of the Code of Criminal Procedure determines the power of the investigating judge to decide to place the accused under judicial supervision, it is clearly written. Mr. Heang Bothy did not understand, and between the detention regime and the regime under judicial supervision, he did not separate, it is clear that Dr. is not yet capable of analyzing other matters. No! ”
The Ministry of Justice spokesman reacted after Heang Rithy, in an interview with Radio Free Asia, criticized the court's move to place Kem Sokha under judicial scrutiny, which put him in jail. Keep in the house. Cambodia, China agree to strengthen bilateral cooperation and share good experiences to prevent tax evasion, while agreement on double tax avoidance will be implemented in early 2019
During the valuable meeting, the senior leaders of the two countries' tax administrations agreed to strengthen bilateral cooperation in the field of taxation, strengthen the provision of better services to taxpayers, and share experiences and practices. Good as well as preventing tax evasion.
On that occasion, the delegation recalled the history of the establishment of diplomatic relations between the two countries, which has lasted for 60 years, which is the basis for the continuation of further cooperation in all fields.
In addition, at the invitation of the General Department of Taxation of Cambodia, the Tax Administration of the People's Republic of China accepted an invitation to pay an official visit to the General Department of Taxation of Cambodia and to attend a workshop scheduled for early 2019. In order to promote and strengthen the provision of services to Chinese-owned enterprises and Chinese taxpayers who are doing business in Cambodia.
It should also be noted that Cambodia and China will start implementing the Agreement on the Avoidance of Double Taxation (DTA) from the beginning of 2019 onwards, the implementation of this agreement will greatly benefit Cambodian investors who There are business activities in China as well as Chinese investors who are doing business in Cambodia. The King issued a Royal Decree appointing and appointing 5 advisors to the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications
