However, the President of the Cambodian Red Cross still urges local people everywhere to know how to help each other, while the authorities must be ready to intervene and save people at all times, regardless of color, religion or Any political tendencies and if any situation needs to be reported to superiors immediately.
Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen said, "I would like to send a message to my parents and siblings, especially on hygiene issues, which we used to always bring water for them and me to drink, but the sewage has a lot of germs in the family. Each one boils water for the family to reduce the pain and let the house be cleaned.
