Notice! The National Social Security Fund for Civil Servants will pay the November Social Security Fund to retirees and former civil servants from November 16.
(Phnom Penh): The National Social Security Fund for Civil Servants of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation will pay the Social Security Fund for November 2018 and the pension policy for November 2018 to retirees and former civil servants from November 16, 2018, according to Canadia Bank and ACLEDA Bank in 25 capitals and provinces nationwide.
According to the announcement of the National Social Security Fund for Civil Servants, obtained by Fresh News on November 14, 2018, "Social Security Policy Funds and Social Security Supplements for Retirees and People Loss of professional fitness for November 2018 will be open from November 16, 2018.
Chinese e-commerce giant Alibaba said it had raised $ 30.7 billion in online sales on its Singles Day on Nov. 11. 2018. Total online sales of companies such as The Mall and Taobao on Sunday rose 27 percent from a year earlier to just $ 24 billion.
In supermarkets across major cities in China, shoppers are rushing to collect shopping vouchers, both online and at tens of thousands of retail stores.
"This year we saw a lot of people come to buy a variety of products, such as cosmetics and health care products," said Jiang Xin, a spokesman for Alibaba's 11th November Shopping Day. "Those products are growing in demand."
Shipping orders purchased this year also broke new records for Singles Day. This is a difficult situation for freight forwarders. But Cainiao, Alibaba's shipping company, claims it is ready to handle the situation.
Alibaba has been running such an annual online discount program since November 11, 2009. November 11th is a single day celebrated by young people in China.
