Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, stated that in line with the Rectangular Strategy Phase III for Employment Growth, Equity and Efficiency in Cambodia of the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Social Sector in Cambodia. Chea has made great progress in recent years, especially in the fifth term of the Royal Government of Cambodia, with many achievements.
