The Minister stated that these are successful achievements in the social sector in the fifth mandate of the Royal Government, while some challenges remain to be addressed in the sixth mandate of the Royal Government through implementation. Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 for Employment Growth, Equity and Efficiency.
On behalf of the Chairman of the Eighth Commission in this new mandate, Ms. Lok Kheng, together with the members of the Commission, will strengthen the cooperation with the Ministry by jointly thinking, implementing and taking responsibility for the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 of the Royal Government. . She also asked Minister Vong Soth to appoint a liaison officer to work closely with the commission to complement each other.
