(Phnom Penh): Mr. Soy Kosal, President of the National League of Municipal, District, Khan, Commune and Sangkat Councils, this morning, November 14, 2018, opened a one-and-a-half-day training course on two lessons: First: Global Principles of Governance Good and second: Orientation to the newly elected council.
The training was facilitated by trainers from the National Association of Capital and Provincial Councils, Mr. Em Deth, Member of Tbong Khmum Provincial Council and Mr. Suon Sothy, Member of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Council. The training on both lessons was conducted in order to enhance the capacity of the leaders of the Association of Municipal, District, Khan, Commune and Sangkat Councils from 25 capitals-provinces to organize further training for councilors in each province.
