At the same time, Pursat Chamber of Commerce conducted the first election for the first mandate in 2006 with 15 members. He further stated that according to the article of Sub-Decree No. 42 dated 17 May 2002, these 8 members have terminated their mandate and must hold the second mandate election to fill the expired members. .
