Two mobile phone thieves were chased by the police and fled on an SL motorcycle after acting in Trapeang Kraloeng market, Phnom Sruoch district
(Kampong Speu): Police in Kampong Speu province confiscated a motorcycle belonging to two suspects after fleeing, leaving the motorcycle on the street while trying to escape from the police in the case of seizing a mobile phone in a mobile phone shop. This incident happened on the afternoon of November 13, 2018 at Trapeang Kraloeng market, Kirivan commune, Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province.
