The King issues a Royal Decree appointing and appointing a total of 55 members of the Council of Jurists and Advisers to the Jurists Council
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, has issued a Royal Decree appointing and appointing a total of 55 members of the Council of Jurists and Advisers to the Council of Jurists. This is according to the Royal Decree on the appointment and conferment of the King, which was received by Fresh News on November 13, 2018.
