Mr. Pheng Nil confirmed that as a result, after the implementation of the work and took samples of 39 items, in which our officers confiscated 20 kilograms of unbranded noodles, 05 kilograms of dried crackers, dried fish. One kilogram, including one kilogram of moon cake, was found to contain Borax, which affects people's health.
