(Kampong Thom): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen have announced the construction of a two-story, 12-room school building for Kraya Secondary School in Kraya Commune, Santuk District, Kampong Thom Province.
