According to the Deputy Governor of Santuk District, as of 2018, there are 25 school buildings donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, including 22 stone buildings and wooden buildings. There are three. In addition, it has helped build a number of other achievements that serve the learning of students as well.
