(Phnom Penh): 70 million Riels was handed over to a factory worker named Nuon Sophy, 36 years old, born in Kong Pisey district, Kampong Speu province, who currently works in a garment factory in Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Speaking to the team that handed over the prize to Miss Nuon Sophy's house, she said that on the night of November 5, 2018, while working night shifts, she bought a can of Carabao energy drink to keep from falling asleep. When I went to bed, when I opened the earrings, I saw a prize of 70 million riels on the earrings.
