(Siem Reap): The ASEAN Regional Center for Mine Action (ARMAC), headquartered in Phnom Penh, has organized a regional workshop on “Strengthening Mine Action Knowledge and Promoting a Forum for Knowledge Sharing. "More mine action for ASEAN members." This workshop was held for 2 days from 12 to 14 November 2018 in Siem Reap.
