In commemoration of this wonderful day, the Cambodian Ambassador to France, Mr. Cham Vidya, highlighted the history and current situation and the importance of the 155-year-old Cambodian-French bilateral relations (1863-2018) that allowed God The Kingdom of Cambodia is committed to building strong state institutions in accordance with the rule of law.
