At the end of the rainy season, farmers face a lack of water to irrigate their rice.
(Kampong Cham): After inspecting the rice fields of the people in Vihea Thom commune, Kampong Siem district, there is a lack of irrigation water, the Governor of Kampong Cham province, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, on the afternoon of November 10, 2018, decided to add another water pump. To save those rice fields in time.
It should be noted that during the end of the rainy season 2018, not only Kampong Cham province, which suffered from drought, lack of water to irrigate rice fields and other crops in some provinces are also facing this difficult problem, which is required To have the intervention of the authorities, ministries and departments to help farmers who are experiencing problems in their agriculture.
According to residents of Pong village in Vihear Thom commune, Mr. Un Nem said that at present, many hectares of rain-fed rice throughout Vihea Thom commune, Kampong Siem district, have been threatened by drought, some of which are almost non-existent. Tragically damaged.
The farmer said that today there is a pump that the Kampong Cham provincial authorities have been stationed to pump water from Boeung Thom to the farmers' rice fields, but that machine can save some rice fields, especially in some rice fields in some communes. Still not rescued yet.
According to farmer Unem, 20 years ago, the rice fields in Vihear Thom commune had experienced a drought, and since then, there has been no problem, only this year, the rice fields in Vihear Thom commune have been threatened by This drought again.
After receiving the news of the drought, the Governor of Kouch Chamroeun Province led a team of specialized departments to directly study the situation and find ways to save the rice fields and other crops of the people who are suffering. The threat of that drought.
After discussing with professional officials, the active provincial governor decided to install an additional pump to speed up the pumping of water to save the rice fields in time.
