Leaders of APSARA Authority pay tribute to the heroes and commemorate the 65th anniversary of National Independence Day
(Siem Reap): The leaders of APSARA Authority this morning, November 9, 2018, participated in the ceremony to honor the martyrs and commemorate the 65th anniversary of the National Independence Day and the founding day of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, November 9, 1953-November 9. 2018, which was held at the Veterans Memorial Monument in Siem Reap.
The ceremony was attended by government officials, forces at all levels, as well as students to lay wreaths in honor of the martyrs, warriors and patriotic heroes who sacrificed their precious lives for the cause of the motherland and the people.
