Twin roads, parks, trees, flowers, and street lighting to beautify Preah Vihear City
(Preah Vihear): Originally, Preah Vihear was a remote province, but now Preah Vihear is no longer a remote province because it has created a lot of infrastructure, especially access roads. This province is good, easy to travel.
