According to Mr. Samleang Try, the construction site of the twin roads in Preah Vihear city is 2,170 meters long, 1 meter wide and 4 meters wide. 18 meters on each side, including the sidewalks.
He also stated that in Preah Vihear province, there are 500 registered cars. Well, this stretch of road, even for the next 10 years, there will be no traffic jams. After the construction of the park divides this road, the city of Preah Vihear will show off another level of beauty.
