Cambodia, Indonesia vow to further strengthen cooperation
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, and Mr. Sudirman Haseng, New Ambassador of Indonesia, in a meeting on the afternoon of November 7, 2018, pledged to strengthen the relationship between the two countries to grow and become stronger. In addition, through security cooperation such as drug trafficking, transnational crime and so on.
