Be careful! Went out to catch fish, but accidentally killed himself, leaving his wife and children in Preah Vihear province
(Preah Vihear): A man lost his life, leaving his wife and children miserable while the man went fishing, but unfortunately shocked himself. This incident happened at 12:30 on November 08, 2018 at O Tram Tem, Srayong Tbong Village, Srayong Commune, Kulen District, Preah Vihear Province.
Lieutenant Colonel Lahn Ly Sivleng, Kulen District Police Inspector, quoted the victim's wife this morning as saying that before the incident at around 8:00 pm on November 7, 2018, the victim Go fishing alone. Until 12:30 pm, company security came to report that the victim shocked himself to death in the water.
Immediately after receiving the information, the victim's wife reported to the police and went to the scene and lifted the body out of the water. After the examination, the authorities concluded that the victim really died from self-shock and handed over the body to the family for a traditional ceremony.
According to the district inspector, the victim was named Cheth Channa, male, 38 years old, occupation: company worker, wife: Meng Pov, 34 years old, hometown: Andong Svay village, Andong Svay commune, Rolea Bier district, Kampong Chhnang province. Above. A Chinese Taiwanese man stole a plot to encroach on the land of nearly 300 families and several government buildings in Kampong Seila district, Preah Sihanouk provincial governor has already sent documents to the Ministry to reject the plan
