Ms. Pen Chhada made this remark during the "Dissemination Workshop on Public Financial Management Reform Program, Procurement and Inventory Management Procedures under the Public Phase III Public Financial Management Reform Program". This is organized for 2 days from November 7-8, 2018.
She said the workshop was aimed at raising awareness, support and active participation of national and sub-national officials in the third phase of the public financial management reform program, as well as capacity building. To all relevant officials to better understand the implementation of procurement procedures in the budget, programs and procedures to manage the state inventory.
