(Kratie): Mr. Vathorn, Governor of Kratie Province, issued a notification that the provincial administration does not grant social land concessions to 98 families in 2 Thnou commune, Snuol district, Kratie province, who are claiming the land of Memot Rubber Plantation Company, claiming that The families have already received the land.
