Authorities said that in the case of the fire above, two houses were completely burnt down. The house of 55-year-old Vong, whose house was 8 by 11 meters wide, was completely damaged by the fire. Another house was also damaged.
According to the report, the fire brigade of Stung Treng Provincial Police used 3 water tankers and took control of the situation at around 3 pm.
