According to the police, the victim was Heng, 41 years old, living in Banteay village, Kandeang Reay commune, Svay Teap district. The current driver lives in Prey Koki village, Prey Koki commune, Chantrea district, Svay Rieng province. After the incident, the authorities detained him and took him to the Svay Teap District Inspectorate to wait for legal procedures.
