Vanna was born into a poor family in the above commune village, when she was 7 months old, her mother died. Orphaned, her parents are looking for a new family and living in poverty, Vanna did not study as deeply as other children.
From time immemorial, Vanna has been wandering around earning all kinds of money to support herself and her elderly grandfather. A few years ago, Vanna had a job as a welder. The welding business, despite earning only 350,000 riel per month, helped Vanna's life to improve a bit compared to when he was young.
But the improvement in life as a young adult is not much, another new life torture came to eat the life of this sad young man. In 2015, while working as a welder in Kratie province, Vanna was electrocuted but did not endanger his life. Although her life was saved, Vanna had her arms amputated on both sides.
The torture of life again made Vanna think short and want to end her life one by one. Grandpa's advice became a medicine to help this young man strengthen his spirit to try to live again.
Upon receiving explanations from his grandfather and encouragement from the villagers, Vanna struggled to live on the planet again and live with dignity. Some people, not to mention Vanna, who is paralyzed in both arms, despite their physical fitness, do not struggle with dignity. White heart.
To support himself and his elderly grandfather, Vanna now has the idea of raising chickens and buying cows to raise and sell to earn some money. Vanna's raising chickens is not big, she raises only a little through the budget, which is sponsored by some philanthropists.
Last week, Oknha Phasok Dr. Keang Seng, CEO of Keang Seng Simon Internet Company, visited Vanna's hut, bringing a large amount of food and money to him.
Tycoon Keang Seng, who was an orphan and had struggled through many tragic life scenes, expressed great sympathy for Vanna. The tycoon was also amazed at Vanna's spirit of overcoming obstacles, especially his reluctance to beg.
Vanna's desire for the future is to have a decent chicken coop that can raise a lot of chickens and be strong enough to protect thieves who often steal their chickens. Vanna also wants a light bulb to incubate an egg. Vanna believes that if they have a decent chicken coop and another incubator, they will try to make a living.
