(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presides over the opening ceremony of a regional international conference on "Fighting Counterfeit and Substandard Medicines" held this Monday morning, November 5, 2018 at Sofitel Phuket Hotel. Seal.
* On behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is pleased to organize a regional conference on "Combating Counterfeit and Substandard Medicines"
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this conference is very important, given the opportunity to work together to fight counterfeit and substandard drugs, which is a global problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that medicine is important for treating diseases, but counterfeit medicine is becoming a threat to people's health and hindering economic development.
* The Prime Minister emphasized that counterfeit drugs are actively circulating in the online market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the work of combating and preventing counterfeit drugs can not be done by any country alone and be successful, that is, there must be stronger cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends that the perpetrators of counterfeit drugs be severely punished.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the lack of cooperation of relevant institutions has led to the implementation of measures to crack down on counterfeit drugs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that in the 1980s, when the health department went down to catch counterfeit medicine. The health department often loses to the seller because the tax department collects the tax from the seller of the medicine, which makes the seller justify that they are legal. Therefore, when advocating in court, the Ministry of Health always loses to drug sellers.
At this point, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that the cooperation of all stakeholders is very important in the fight against and suppression of counterfeit drugs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to include a forum on counterfeit and substandard medicines in other regional discussions, such as the ASEAN Summit or the Mekong-Lan Chang Summit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also wants to bring the topic of counterfeit and substandard medicines to the Asia-Europe Meeting, which Cambodia will host in 2020.
