(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sar Sokha, Vice President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, this morning, October 3, 2018, presided over the 2018 General Assembly of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia in Prey Veng, Battambang and Banteay Meanchey Provinces, which took place at the Huangshan Hotel in front of the Australian Embassy. Phnom Penh.
