(Mondulkiri): The director of the Mondulkiri Provincial Forestry Administration has come out in full denial of the allegations on Facebook regarding a truck carrying wood overturning, killing one person and seriously injuring another in Mondulkiri province's Oreang district last night. November 1, 2018.
