(Kampong Speu): Wat Preah Ko Po Pruek, located along National Road 4, Komar Pey Village, O Commune, Phnom Sruoch District, Kampong Speu Province. 200 million riels for the construction of achievements in the pagoda, plus the suffix of the Buddhists at the foot of the pagoda more than 8 million riels, meanwhile, the two tycoons also donated an additional 50 million riels for other expenses.
