(Phnom Penh): On the evening of November 1, 2018, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of the Board of Governors of Phnom Penh, led a delegation from Phnom Penh Capital Administration to leave Phnom Penh on an official visit to France to attend the 1st General Assembly. 38 of the International Association of Mayors in French (AIMF) from 1 to 10 November 2018.
