(Phnom Penh): Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, emphasized that Cambodia is a country with the best investment protection policy with high potential in agriculture, industry, manufacturing (light) technology and services that New Zealand investors can benefit greatly. And high return on investment.
