A motorcyclist was hit by a car and killed, while the driver disappeared in Banan district.
(Battambang): A man riding a motorcycle at high speed turned the steering wheel and hit in front of the car, causing his death immediately, while the driver of the car disappeared and the victim's body was taken to the family home for a traditional ceremony And both means shall be taken by the provincial traffic police to be stored at the office of legal settlement at a later time.
This incident happened at 18:30 on October 30, 2018 on National Road 57 at Group 6, Romchey village, Snoeng commune, Banan district, Battambang province.
As for the Hyundai brand car with license plate Svay Rieng 3A-0716, the unidentified driver fled, leaving the car at the scene.
After the incident, the victim's body was taken to his family for a traditional ceremony at home. As for cars and motorcycles, they were temporarily stored by the provincial traffic police, waiting for both parties to come and solve them according to the law at a later time. Communes are safe for the people to have a basic life
