Separately, Dr. Kim Heang, President of CVEA also stated that the mission to attend the annual meeting of the NAR will provide many benefits for the leaders and members of the Association to learn more related to new technologies in the land business. "This program focuses on the topic of the future of global land business, so it is a good opportunity for global landowners to come together to learn from each other," he said.
