(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of October 30, 2018, Mr. Duch Sok Sarin, Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, issued an order to detain two of the three suspects in the case of theft and put them in jail. Waiting for the trial, while another suspect was released by Deputy Prosecutor Hung Bunthon. This is according to the revelation from the authorities to Fresh News Agency in the court, Mr. Chuon Socheat in the evening of the same day.
