After the arrest, the police confiscated 3 cars, 1 motorbike and 10 license plates. National Bank of Cambodia: The introduction of the Chinese yuan in the banking system is only for trade settlement between China and Cambodia, not to promote the circulation of the yuan in Cambodia like the dollar
(Phnom Penh): The Technical Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, Ms. Chea Serey, on October 30, 2018, further confirmed the case of the introduction of Chinese yuan payment in the banking system in Cambodia, claiming that the introduction This is only to promote mutual settlement in trade relations between Cambodia and China, not to encourage Chinese yuan to circulate in Cambodia like the dollar.
"The introduction of the RMB by the National Bank is an incentive for trade settlement," Chea Serey said. Do not confuse it with the circulation of the yuan in Cambodia, as the circulation of the dollar is not the direction of the National Bank. The goal of the National Bank is to promote the spending of the national riel.
The technical director general of the National Bank of Cambodia confirmed that the use of the Chinese yuan in the banking system for trade payments also helped boost the riel. As for the use of the yuan in trade settlements, she explained that in the past, trade between Cambodia and China had to use the dollar, putting them at risk of interest rates.
However, the National Bank of Cambodia does not prohibit the issuance of yuan if sellers and buyers agree to accept it.
According to Ms. Chea Serey, the National Bank of Cambodia also wants to promote the use of the national currency in trade settlements between ASEAN countries to facilitate trade with each other.
Please be informed that recently, in a program, Mr. Su Sannith, Deputy Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia, expressed his support for the use of the yuan in Cambodia through the banking system to facilitate bilateral trade, investment and tourism. More efficient.
Through this, investors, traders and recipients of RMB income can pay, borrow and deposit RMB in the banking system, which allows the National Bank of Cambodia to better manage the circulation of the RMB through the banking system and contribute to the growth of trade. Investment and tourism workers from China.
ACLEDA Bank President and CEO In Channy supported the introduction of Chinese yuan in the banking system as a good sign for Cambodia's economic growth and trade at a time when Chinese investors and Chinese business - Cambodia is growing rapidly.
In particular, for an independent economic analyst in Cambodia, Mr. Chan Sophal expressed positiveness in the introduction of yuan payments in the banking system between China and Cambodia. He said it would make it easier for Chinese to visit, trade and invest in Cambodia, which would help boost trade and the economy as more investors were investing in Cambodia.
According to the Ministry of Commerce, bilateral trade between Cambodia and China in 2017 reached $ 4.8 billion, of which exports from Cambodia amounted to $ 830 million and imports to Cambodia amounted to $ 3.9 billion. As of April 2018, Chinese investment in Cambodia totaled about 17 billion US dollars, the largest investor in Cambodia.
