Nationwide Traffic Law Enforcement Campaign, October 30: 666 illegal vehicles were found and 466 fines were imposed.
(Phnom Penh): The nationwide traffic law enforcement campaign for October 30, 2018, the traffic police force inspected 4,729 vehicles and found 666 vehicles violating the law (85% motorcycles), 200 education vehicles and 466 fines. This is according to the official report of the Traffic Police and Public Order Department of the General Commission of the National Police.
