Tomorrow, the Court of Appeal will announce the verdict in the case of Miss Van Nyla, whose ex-girlfriend leaked nude photos, Van Nyla called on the Court of Appeal to give her justice like the court
(Phnom Penh): The case of the beautiful young singer, Miss Sok Chenda alias Van Nyla, will be announced by the Court of Appeal on October 31, 2018, tomorrow, related to the case of intentional violence and distribution of pornographic images. Committed by his ex-girlfriend, a police officer of the Ministry of Interior in 2015.
Ms. Van Nyla, the victim in this case, through Fresh News on October 30, 2018, called on the Court of Appeal to continue to give justice to her like the Phnom Penh Municipal Court in the past. Give justice as intended and she is very satisfied with the conviction of her ex-boyfriend by the court.
"Tomorrow, the Court of Appeal will announce its verdict in my case, and I would like to appeal to the Court of Appeal to continue to give me justice like the Phnom Penh Municipal Court," the young singer said.
Please be reminded that singer Van Nyla received justice from the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, with the accused being his ex-girlfriend, Mr. Kuy Sithisak, was sentenced to one year in prison and fined about 200 Million riel (US $ 50,000) in the case of her nude photo theft in 2015.
"Hello everyone, this is good news," Vanilla wrote on her Facebook page. The court has already announced the verdict at the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. 1- Conviction of Kuy Sithisak for 1 year, 2- Compensation for mental illness 200 million Riels.
Van Nyla continued, "I would like to thank all Cambodians, both inside and outside the country. Thank you to the Friends of Volunteer Arts Association, Dara Kampuchea Family, Mr. Nuon Bora and Mr. Chea Sok Chan, as well as the artists who signed the petition for more than 600 petitions through the Minister of Culture to promote the Ministry's action. Interior. I would like to thank you very much. I will provide more details shortly.
It is remembered that before receiving the light of justice for the singer Van Nyla, her ex-boyfriend, Mr. Kuy Sithisak, who is out of the law, despite receiving a sentence, used to send The threatening message, using abusive words, despises her so much that the power of the son of a high-ranking official makes her feel hopeless at times, too.
It should be noted that the case of the accused Kuy Sithisak with Ms. Sok Chenda alias Van Nyla related to violence and posting nude pictures is now the verdict of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on the afternoon of August 15, convicting the accused Imprisoned for one year and ordered to pay compensation to the plaintiff 200 million Riels.
In announcing the verdict, Mr. Kor Vandy, Deputy Chief of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, was not heard announcing the arrest warrant for Kuy Sithisak (no arrest warrant was issued), but opened the way for the detainee. Charge an appeal in accordance with the law.
Kuy Sithisak was charged with “intentional violence and distribution of pornographic images” in Phnom Penh during 2016 under Articles 217 of the Penal Code and Articles 38 and 39 of the Law on the Suppression of Human Trafficking and Doing sex work.
Under the care of the Prime Minister, Senior Minister Kun Kim continues to distribute the National Social Security Fund to more than 2,500 veterans in Pursat province
(Pursat): Senior Minister Kun Kim, Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, on October 30, 2018, met and distributed 2,511 veterans of Pursat National Social Security Fund.
After sending a message of greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen to members of the Veterans, Senior Minister Kun Kim confirmed that today's gathering was aimed at thanking all the members who voted for the party. People even win the lottery.
