At the same time, the Senior Minister Secretary-General instructed the Provincial Veterans Association to visit any members who are landless and if they agree to go to Leach commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Samdech and provide a house.
The Senior Minister, who is active in the work of the Veterans Association, also advised members that only Samdech Techo Hun Sen is always thinking, so must believe and respect the leadership of Samdech so that Cambodia can continue to develop in all areas.
