Kampong Cham Provincial Governor: Citizens can file a complaint if they demand payment in excess of the OWSO limit
(Kampong Cham): Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, told the people to complain to the provincial authorities immediately if there is a case to pay more than the service fee of the OWSO of Kampong Cham Provincial Hall because the price for Public Service The OWSO of the Provincial Hall has already been announced.
This was stated by the provincial governor on the morning of October 30, 2018, on the occasion that he led the provincial council and some relevant officials to participate in a public forum with more than 300 people in Stok Thom village, Tang Krasaing commune, Batheay district, Kampong Cham province.
In that forum, people raised issues related to payment of inheritance service, electricity issue, ID card issue, and asked to develop a canal system to respond to the problems of the people, the provincial governor required professional officers to respond to the people. Immediately and immediately find a solution, in which public problems are solved immediately and some problems need to be studied and solved later.
The provincial governor also told people to be careful when spending money on various document services, because the price limit for public services, the OWSO of the provincial hall has already been announced, so you have to spend accordingly. The price is set, and if there is a requirement to pay more than the declared service fee, the people will immediately complain and the provincial authorities will take action.
The provincial governor also confirmed that in order to know the price of public services, please log in to the Facebook page of the OWSO in Kampong Cham and you will see.
