(Phnom Penh): The new building of Kosomak Hospital, also known as Lok Sang Hospital, will start construction on the morning of October 30, 2018 tomorrow, with an area of 28,900 square meters on a total area of 13,740 square meters and cost Approximately US $ 80 million, equipped with medical equipment and facilities, as well as training.
