Please be informed that in response to the growth and the need for health care of the people who come to see and treat this hospital, the Royal Government of Cambodia has submitted a proposal to the Government of the People's Republic of China and received approval to study the project at the end of the year. 2015 ago to build a new building.
The new hospital building will take 40 months to build, with a height of 53 meters, 11 floors, a service life of 50 years, adapted to the dry and wet seasons, water supply and drainage system. Sewage complies with Chinese standards in accordance with the actual situation, a total of 132 rooms, 219 toilets.
