Ms. Khuon Sodary said this at a special press conference at Phnom Penh International Airport on the morning of October 28, 2018, after completing the mission to lead a delegation of the Cambodian People's Party to attend the 10th General Assembly of the International Conference of Asian Political Parties. (ICAPP) in Moscow, Russian Federation from October 24 to 27, 2018.
