Brigadier General Kol Phaly, Deputy Commissioner for Criminal Planning, told Fresh News this morning, October 25, 2018, that the murder of the construction foreman occurred on the night of October 22, 2018 in Group 32 Village. 5 Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, caused the death of a construction foreman after being sent to the Provincial Referral Hospital.
