General Khieu Sopheak, Chief of Cabinet of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, confirmed to Fresh News that on October 24, 2018, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, disagreed with the request of General Neth Savoeun. The National Police Commissioner, who requested to change the location of the land and the building of the National Police General Commission to Dangkor district, this note has been made since January 11, 2018.
