(Ratanakkiri): The case of the murder of Karong dropped into a well more than 6 months ago at the cashew plantation in Ta Kab village, Ta Ang commune, Kon Mom district, Ratanakkiri province, now the police force has arrested the perpetrator Cheat Kreung.
According to a report from Fresh News Agency in Ratanakkiri province, this morning, October 23, 2018, yesterday, October 22, the Provincial Criminal Bureau in cooperation with the Kon Mom District Inspector Force searched and arrested the perpetrator named Kiel. Ka Tuot, 20, Kreung, lives in Ta Kab village, Ta Ang commune, Kon Mom district, Ratanakkiri province.
After the arrest, the suspect confessed that he had actually killed the victim, Su Seak, because he was angry that the victim owed money to buy wood and refused to pay, so he called the victim. Arrived at the scene, cut a knife to the back of the neck, causing death at the scene, and then transported the body and motorcycle to drop into the well, which he did alone.
After hearing the confession, the specialized force and with the coordination of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Prosecutor brought the suspect to the location of the crime scene and the water well where the body was dumped. The suspect is currently being held at the Ratanakkiri Provincial Police Commissioner's Office of Serious Crimes to complete the case file and send it to the court for further proceedings.
