Finally! Judge Nuon Chan Makara sentenced to 2 years and 6 months in prison and $ 180,000 in damages for selling German land in Phnom Sruoch district
(Phnom Penh): The Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court has sentenced Nuon Chan Makara to 2 years and 6 months imprisonment and ordered to compensate 18 victims for damages and other damages. Ten thousand US dollars for the crime of forging documents to sell more than 1,000 hectares of land of a German company in Dambok Rong commune, Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province.
Judge Seng Leang announced the verdict on the afternoon of October 19, 2018, after several trials, and only the victims and their lawyers were present on the day of the verdict. Defendants and defense lawyers were not present as at the previous hearing.
On 31 October 2017, the Court of Appeal released the accused on bail, but placed him under judicial supervision and barred him from leaving the borders of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Defendants must appear in court when summoned.
It should also be noted that during the previous hearing in front of the judge and the prosecution, as well as the public in the entire courtroom, the accused stated that she had sold only about 60 hectares of land to pay off debts. Of Mr. Reynner, who owed them in the past and to solve life problems. But in fact, she conspired with the local authorities and entered into a contract to sell almost all of the company's 1,100 hectares of land to a person named
Mr. Reynor stated that for all these reasons, at the last hearing, both his lawyer and himself asked the court to take legal action and investigate to bring those involved in the wrongdoing. Those laws also come to punish, and if the perpetrator Nuon Chan Makara continues to live out of jail, we do not know if he continues to commit any other crimes.
BEIJING, Oct. 22 (Xinhua) - Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, accompanied by a high-level Cambodian military delegation, arrived in Beijing on the afternoon of October 22, 2018. A warm welcome from Major General Hang, Deputy Director of the International Relations Department of the Chinese Ministry of Defense.
The visit to China of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and the Cambodian military delegation took place from October 22 to 24, 2018. The 8th Sieng San Forum, which will be attended by Samdech Pichey Sena, will take place from October 24, 2018. The Prince will also address the plenary session of "United Nations Peacekeeping Challenges and Cooperation."
