The president also promised to assist Cambodia in becoming an observer for the Organization for Islamic Cooperation, of which Turkey will chair in 2019.
Managers of Cambodian Derivatives Exchange share experiences on derivatives trading as the sector gains momentum in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): Currently, derivatives trading in Cambodia is gaining more and more recognition, and derivatives brokers, both domestic and foreign, have been established to provide trading services on this new financial product to Cambodian investors. So that they can diversify their investment options.
Among them, Cambodian Derivatives Exchange has been actively involved in promoting the legitimate financial markets, the implementation of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, bringing international trade standards, as well as sharing resources that lead to This company is considered to be a pioneer in the financial market.
"In addition, I share as well as educate investors and guide them to understand the financial market in all aspects and can make a successful investment," she said. "Through my many years of experience in this field, I understand that the financial market in Cambodia is evolving to meet international standards."
She added that in the field of derivatives, Cambodian Derivatives Exchange has accomplished a lot, which can be said that educating the inexperienced and inexperienced investors in the derivatives market in Cambodia is not easy, but they We are happy to do.
"We are happy to see that more and more local investors are eager to learn about the sector," she said. Cambodian Derivatives Exchange has always been on a mission to make history in Cambodia by promoting legitimate markets and boosting economic operations. Cambodians deserve standard trading practices and derivative knowledge and use of investment skills to create a rich life.
She said that as mentioned above, Cambodian Derivatives Exchange has taken great care to provide education to investors, so through close cooperation with the Association of Appraisers and Real Estate Agents of Cambodia, we can use the strength together. To share knowledge and expertise to a wider fan base and across Cambodia.
In addition, the company aims to raise public awareness of the benefits of different investments, meaning that clients can diversify their investment portfolio to reduce risks and increase return on investment. Improved. She added.
As mentioned above, we have seen many important results that have been developed by her and her company. What are your plans for the future?
She added that standing in this market has made the company very successful. "My plan and that of the company in the future is that we will continue to educate the Cambodian people on the realities of the derivatives sector and how to take advantage of the educational process, not only in Phnom Penh, but will continue to share," she said. To other provinces as well.
She stressed that the company's efforts are to make it easier for investors who want to invest and increase income to find investment information and receive training. Cambodian Derivatives Exchange will hold seminars with the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia in five provinces to raise awareness of the derivatives sector and promote this financial investment to all sectors in Cambodia.
