According to Prey Veng CamControl officers, during the inspection, the experts conducted a preliminary analysis on noodles, noodles, noodles, fish paste, palm sugar, and a total of eight samples, which resulted in the presence of Borax banned chemicals. 12 kg of small fiber noodles.
