Mr. Sok Sangvar, Deputy Director General of APSARA Authority, stated on the occasion of the tree planting ceremony that on behalf of the Angkor Resort Management Authority, APSARA Authority is very warmly welcomed for the ASEAN Student Council's visit to explore Angkor civilization from Japan. In particular, participation in planting seedlings, which contributes to the value of the cultural landscape of Angkor, as well as the greenery of the planet in the territory of Angkor.
