Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, who presided over the planting ceremony, stated that today's tree planting program is the best way to show the efforts to strengthen the solidarity between Cambodia and Japan, as well as ASEAN and Japan. Discover the natural areas, history, and heritage of the world.
