Third, the Water Cooperation Agreement was signed between Mr. Prak Sokhon, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, and Dr. Bekir Pakdemirli, Minister of Agriculture and Forestry.
Fourth, the Agreement on the Promotion and Reciprocal Protection of Investment was signed between Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Secretary-General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, and Mr. Mustafa Varark, Minister of Industry and Technology.
Fifth, the Sports Cooperation Agreement was signed between Mr. Prak Sokhon, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, and Mr. Mehmet Muharrem, Minister of Youth and Sports.
