Annual economic growth of 7%, GDP by sector, of which services accounted for more than 61%, industry for more than 31% and agriculture for 6%. Turkey's main exports are garments, foodstuffs, textiles, hardware and transport equipment, while machinery, oil, chemicals, semi-finished products and transport equipment are included.
