1. By a public servant within the framework of his function or on the occasion of his performance. 2. By a person who presents himself as a public servant. 3. By a person who calls on the public to issue securities. 4: By individuals who appeal to the public to raise funds for humanitarian or social assistance. 5. Organized groups.
