(Belgium): On the evening of October 19, 2018, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, met with more than 1,000 Cambodians living in Europe in Brussels.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the former opposition group dared to declare threats to block Samdech supporters, which shows that they are not yet in power, dare to threaten such brothers and sisters until they are in power.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that any meeting he could cancel, but this meeting with our Cambodian people is absolutely impossible.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces to Cambodians living in Europe that Cambodia is honored to host the Asia-Europe Summit in 2020
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that this Asia-Europe Summit has nothing to say about Cambodia, only the decision to give Cambodia the right to host the Asia-Europe Summit in 2020.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that upon his return home, the Minister of Foreign Affairs will begin to consider the hosting of the Asia-Europe Summit, which is attended by more than 50 countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, announces that Cambodia will host the Asia-Europe Meeting in 2020, in 2022 the ASEAN Summit, in 2023, Cambodia will hold re-elections, Samdech hopes to win the next election. At that time, Samdech will organize a meeting of the Non-Aligned Movement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the main task of the new government is to maintain political stability and peace in order to achieve economic growth of 7.2 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2019, the economic growth target is around 7% while inflation is below 5%.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia suffered less natural disasters than other countries, many of Cambodia's roads were damaged and needed urgent repairs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the imbalance of Cambodia in the past, many people lack food, but now many people have food left. On the other hand, from the beginning, the small road was unpaved, but now the bigger road is narrower because of the increase in traffic.
* The Prime Minister stated that regarding the preferential tariff preferences from the European Union, Cambodia has not lost anything. Samdech Techo stated that this issue was taken as a psychological war on the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo said that the preferential system for Cambodian goods from the European Union will be lost when it becomes a high-economic country. However, Samdech has taken a step with Japan, China and the Asian Development Bank to continue to offer preferential interest rates for 10 years and the possibility of repayment for 40 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia still has a high potential to borrow money from abroad, but Cambodia set a foreign loan rate of only 23 percent compared to the national economy. In other words, Cambodia has the ability to solve its problems on many issues, not all rely on foreign debt.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the preferential tax system has not been affected so far. Samdech Techo raised the question that the United States does not have a preferential tariff system, why are there still companies exporting to the United States, what if Europe removes the preferential tariff system, why does business not happen? Samdech said that business is still happening, just less profit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that since June 20, 1977, the process of the nation could not escape the eyes of Samdech. Samdech Techo said that the process of national liberation and peace talks ... is the legacy of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, it has been 31 years that Samdech has identified four key priority areas for the development of the country, including water, roads, electricity and human resources. But now human resource development is the top priority.
According to Samdech Techo, the Royal Government must increase spending on education and health.
* Samdech Techo said that every trip abroad must meet with the people as well as students of Cambodia.
* Samdech Prime Minister mentioned that some people use the method of cursing the Royal Government to get asylum abroad. Samdech Techo wondered why some countries continue to lose to those people?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the state has to pay about $ 80 million a year to help people use electricity at a lower cost.
* The Prime Minister stated that now the structure of the Cambodian economy has changed and before agriculture was up to 80 percent, industry and services were only 20 percent. But now agriculture is down to 25 percent, industry 30 percent and services 45 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's revenue structure has also changed. Currently, only 40% of customs revenue remains due to Cambodia's participation in the ASEAN Free Trade Area, ASEAN-China and other free trade zones, reducing customs revenue from 80 to around 40%. Internal revenue used to be 20 percent, up to 60 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all revenue transaction data is on Samdech's phone. Samdech Techo said that if the tax revenue is around 4%, he will earn $ 200 million per month.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the use of technology not only facilitates work but also helps reduce corruption.
* Samdech Techo stated that the richest ghost officials in the Lon Nol regime. Cambodia has now eliminated ghost officials almost completely after using the bank payroll system.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some groups of former politicians at the same time cheated both marketers and farmers. When entering the market, promise to lower the price of rice, when entering the field, promise to increase the price of rice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Cambodian people in Europe for stopping to meet Samdech. Samdech Techo said that this is a high encouragement for the leadership of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen addresses Cambodians abroad who have participated in the democratic process by calling on the people to go to the polls. Samdech Techo said that those who oppose the election are against democracy. The Prime Minister added that voting for the Cambodian People's Party is the right choice, meaning that it is an election for peace, development and to continue the efforts of its ancestors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Sam Rainsy to be ashamed and not to compare with others. This statement was made after Samdech saw the prisoner and compared him to other leaders. Samdech Techo also cited Aung San Suu Kyi's comparison. Samdech said that when Aung San Suu Kyi was elected, Sam Rainsy's group of prisoners compared her, but when she had a problem, she compared Samdech to humiliate her.
As with the invitation to the United States, in this meeting with the Cambodians in Europe, Samdech Techo took the educational law of Ngoy and Dr. Ou Chong to the Cambodians in Europe. Samdech Techo said that Samdech has no money, only this book.
