Addressing the leaders of Asia-Europe countries to chair the 13th Asia-Europe Meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, emphasized that Cambodia is extremely honored to host the The 13th Asia-Europe Summit in 2020 in Phnom Penh, the first and most important large-scale summit.
The Ministry of Tourism recommends that all tourism business establishments in coastal provinces have proper wastewater treatment basins, toilets, and sewerage systems.
(Phnom Penh): In order to ensure the sustainable and quality development of tourism in the coastal areas in the tourism service businesses in the coastal areas of Cambodia, the Ministry of Tourism has issued a circular to all service businesses. All tourists in the coastal provinces must have a wastewater treatment plant, toilets, sewerage system in accordance with the proper functioning of their business.
