(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has issued a sub-decree on the establishment of the Prey Prosop Wildlife Sanctuary with a total area of 12,770 hectares in Prek Prosop and Sambo districts of Kratie province.
* To ensure the conservation of wildlife habitats, birds and ecosystems, as well as to ensure that the necessary conditions are met for certain species of wildlife, birds, plants and biodiversity.
