Kampong Cham Police Crack Down on Drugs in "Tang Lay Hong" Guesthouse, Cheung Prey District, Arrested 10 Suspects
(Kampong Cham): Kampong Cham Provincial Police launched a drug busting operation on the evening of October 18, 2018 at the Tang Lay Hong Guesthouse in Skun Village, Sotip Commune, Cheung Prey District, detaining the suspect. 10 men and women and 10 packs of drugs.
Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Em Kosal said that the operation was carried out by the provincial specialized force in cooperation with the specialized force of the Cheung Prey District Police Inspectorate, using provocative rules to detain 10 suspects, two females.
During the operation, the specialized police force confiscated 10 packs of white gram powder (2 big packs and 8 small packs), 9 mobile phones, 2 motorbikes and some packaging materials. The suspects have now been sent to a specialized office to build a case for further proceedings.
