(Phnom Penh): Seeing the suffering of patients in the hospital on Wednesday, October 8, 2018, the Cambodian Red Cross (aka Krak) Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen presided over the delegation led by Secretary-General Pum Chantyny to visit and distribute humanitarian aid to 486 patients who are being treated at Preah Kosomak Hospital (Monk Hospital). ).
