(Pailin): Mr. Hem Rithy, Deputy Governor of Pailin Province, urges relevant units, institutions, local authorities at all levels, communities, partner organizations to cooperate and support with the utmost attention and activism to implement the National Action Plan on Supply. Clean water and rural sanitation promotion, the second phase of 2019-2023 to be successful according to the plan.
